:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[MARCO (Enemy)]].''
'''MARCO''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 215
|rarity = RR
|name1 = MARCO
|name2 = MARCO CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''MARCO CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Despite his freezing capability, MARCO won't save you from the wrath of Aliens. His high cost and single-target attacks make him useless when facing many peons. Use him only if you don't have many [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien units]] and spam him in high numbers.

He functions surprisingly well in [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The Wormhole Opens]], as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] is outranged by the [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]]. He's also usable in [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] of Into the Future Chapter 3, since [[Raging Bahamut Cat]] also outranges Seafarer. However, keep him well protected, as he only outranges Raging Bahamut by 10.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

